  "description": "Provides robust error tracking and distributed logging capabilities for TuanZi framework through Exceptionless, including:\n\t\t\t- Real-time error reporting and monitoring\n\t\t\t- Structured log management\n\t\t\t- Event correlation and workflow tracking\n\t\t\t- Custom tagging and metadata support\n\t\t\t- Seamless integration with TuanZi's diagnostic pipeline\n\t\t\t- Support for distributed tracing\n\t\t\t- Configurable event filtering and enrichment\n\t\t\t- Performance metrics collection",
